"在所选应用发起一轮你自己的任务。安装成功、收到过回调、任务正在运行，是三件不同的事。这里不会替你发请求或填充模拟状态。" = "Start a task of your own in the agent you connected. Connected, has sent an event, and has a task running are three different things. Nothing here sends requests for you or fills in made-up status.";
