"升级时仅维护已接入的观察器；被移除的接入不会自动恢复。未收到回调不等于断连或任务结束，可能正在长时间执行。配置异常请检查，Codex 的信任仍需在 /hooks 审阅；第三方协议变更不能保证自动兼容。豆包仅观察本地 Agent 轨迹，普通聊天不可见。" = "Updates only maintain the integrations you've connected; one you removed won't come back on its own. No events doesn't mean disconnected or finished; a task may simply be running for a long time. If a config looks wrong, check it. Codex still asks you to review trust in /hooks, and changes to a third party's protocol can't be guaranteed to keep working. For Doubao, only local Agent-mode activity is visible, never regular chats.";
"3 · 看清隐私与能力边界" = "3 · Privacy and what it can do";
"Hook 仅保留状态元数据，不保存输入和工具内容。为区分任务，会只读 Codex / WorkBuddy 的会话标题；标题可能包含敏感信息。最近 24 小时是显示窗口，不是自动删除期限。退出不会卸载 Hook，卸载不会删除历史。没有联网分析或云端同步；不要把原始日志和真实标题截图提交到 GitHub。" = "Hooks keep status metadata only, never your input or tool content. To tell tasks apart, it reads the session titles of Codex and Work Buddy, and titles can contain sensitive information. \"Last 24 hours\" is what's shown, not when data is deleted. Quitting doesn't remove the hooks, and removing them doesn't delete history. There are no online analytics and no cloud sync. Don't post raw logs or screenshots of real titles to GitHub.";

